{"text": "Today, however. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Dorothy and Toto were not playing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Uncle Henry sat on the doorstep. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And looked worriedly at the sky. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Which was even grayer than usual. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Dorothy stood in the door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With Toto in her arms. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And looked at the sky, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From the far north. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Came a low wail of the wind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the long grass. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Bowed in waves. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then they heard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A sharp whistling in the air. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From the south. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly Uncle Henry stood up. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And called to his wife. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There is a cyclone coming, Em. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he ran. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Toward the sheds. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Where the cows and horses were kept. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Aunt Em dropped her work. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And came to the door. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One look told her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That the danger was very close. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Quick, Dorothy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She screamed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Run for the cellar.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "o", "d", "a", "y", ",", " ", "h", "o", "w", "e", "v", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "D", "o", "r", "o", "t", "h", "y", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "T", "o", "t", "o", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "p", "l", "a", "y", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "U", "n", "c", "l", "e", " ", "H", "e", "n", "r", "y", " ", "s", "a", "t", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", "s", "t", "e", "p